    "summary": "Use it in the opposing player's Shooting phase or either player's Fight phase, right after a **DIRE AVENGERS** or **GUARDIANS** unit of yours is **destroyed** by an enemy unit. You can use it once per battle round.\n\nPick a **WAR WALKERS** unit of yours. Once the attacking enemy unit's attacks are all resolved, your unit may shoot as though in your own Shooting phase, but only at that enemy unit, provided it is a valid target for your unit.",
